14. With any psychological disorders or neurological/psychiatric disorders confirmed by the investigator.
15. Subjects who have difficulty with venous blood collection,or are afraid of needles or blood, or those who have difficulty with subcutaneous injection administration.
16. Any of the following abnormal in laboratory test results at screening or baseline:

