Exclusion Criteria:

1. Imaging (CT or MRI) shows that the tumor has invaded large blood vessels or those who are judged to be very likely to invade important blood vessels and cause fatal hemorrhage during the follow-up study;
2. Currently participating in interventional clinical research treatment, or receiving treatment with other research drugs or research devices within 4 weeks before the first administration;
