This project proposes:

* a test-retest procedure in healthy subjects aged from 6 to 90 year-old;
* testing in attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) patients before psychostimulant treatment;
* testing in attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) patients before psychostimulant treatment.

