5. Confirmed MF-diagnosis (stage 1a/1b) by histology (or clinico-histopathological correlation) within the last 10 years;
6. Willing and able to washout any topical treatment for MF (at least 2 weeks) and any systemic treatment for MF (at least 4 weeks) prior to Day 1, resulting in a washout of 8 weeks for topical treatment and 10 weeks for disease-related systemic treatment prior to the first dosing day (day 43);
